        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>March 6, 2026</color>\n\"I was under the impression that the wicked mischief of changelings had long since become legend with the end of fae rule. That is, until I met that lively Lady Adventurer after a performance one day... She brought me the most wondrous voices from different corners of the world. Unlike those stuffy old folks in the tundra, she's far more interesting!\"\n— Vodyanitsa, Prima Soprano of the Korolevskiy Troupe\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44074831</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Character Skill Showcase"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/02/151578876/2de146e84b7bd04914eb5749f698b506_3298573985427306258.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>March 31, 2026</color>\nHello, Traveler! Today, we have with us Linnea, advisor at the Adventurers' Guild. She will share with us some survival tactics you can rely on, drawn from her experience in various dangerous situations. Let's see what she has to say!\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44426988</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Character Notes"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/03/151578876/25c59c4a61ebb2e4ee681780f11be185_7166995570172025366.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>April 3, 2026</color>\nHello, Traveler! Following the previous sharing, the Guild has once again invited Advisor Linnea to join us.\nThis time, she's brought along her adventure notes to share with everyone those sweet moments, whimsical ideas and warm memories...\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44470660</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Character Illustrations",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Upcoming Characters 2026"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/08/151578876/c7f85a754c835d214760f8b0912225a6_413933001497210758.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>January 2, 2026</color>\nEven though they don't appear in the picture, Our fates could still become intertwined in the future.\n<color=#80c0ff>X:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/x.com/GenshinImpact/status/2006978768871583808</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "\"Spirit Envoy Championship\" Registration"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/02/151578876/90c9f457adc1bede997db1ee6aa55fd5_8315272177442546177.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>March 29, 2026</color>\nRecently, a tournament invitation issued by the Frostmoon Scions has appeared on notice boards across Teyvat. As for the registration process, it seems a few amusing incidents have already taken place...\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44395806</color>"
      },
